    "detailed_description": "Soul Brave is an online action RPG in a fully 2D world with 3D characters and anime graphics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFrom now on you will enter a world full of magic, mystical creatures and face constant dangers.<br />\r\nAre you ready to gain powers and become one of our warriors?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Choose your Favorite character.<br />\r\n-Take on Epic Quests with a variety of different monsters and Bosses.<br />\r\n-Raise your Lv and Increase your power! Strengthen your equipment.<br />\r\n-Defeat Your friends in a legendary PVP.<br />\r\n-Create pets and make them stronger! They will be your great companions on your journey.<br />\r\n-Customize your character with wonderful Equipment!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe newest MMORPG with 3d and 2d multiplayer graphics.",
